    value: "arXiv:2607.28878"
    description: Paper describing the system
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - voice dictation
  - speech to text
  - voice typing
  - hold to talk
  - push to talk
  - voice commands
  - offline
  - on-device
  - privacy
